{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d35cd30bf56ed3a3eff1b5d6a1fa0934c73b002ab0203ec850d99b92faa99d4", "ja": "（今朝は何となく、早く目が覚めてしまった……。\nこんな日は、いっそ早朝出勤で頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（不知为何，今天起得特别早……\n既然这样，干脆早点出门打拚吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3754469677b7333d9eb5b1416d1f7d548d56a0e18198e97c84669119053efd55", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようございますぅ。", "zh": "{$P$}，早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8207216871fbb9a6da425d136d3953bdbf41487eaeeace2fdbae6078663e233d", "ja": "あれ？　おはよう、雪歩。こんな朝早くから劇場に来る\nなんて……あ、次の公演は雪歩も出るんだっけ。", "zh": "咦？早安，雪步。你怎么这么早就来剧场……\n啊，我记得下一场公演你也有出场？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8a96c8750dae4b66d575ba6eaf370365b4eb482834ebda626e274339253112d2", "ja": "はい、それで朝練させてもらおうと思って……。私、\nちゃんと練習しないと、まだまだダメダメですから。", "zh": "是的，所以我才想来晨练……\n我还是很不行不行，所以要多加练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "88ecae2d789332a9974fd8ff3f04e3164e40f757b603aad592015e5c6a4673d0", "ja": "ダメダメ、でもないと思うけどな。\nこの前の受付嬢の仕事も、評判よかったじゃないか？", "zh": "我想是不至于到不行不行啦。\n之前柜台小姐的工作不也是大受好评吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "330a765202ba73cde8d950869313c347c0ee4d019af7015d2b6f366535430ec7", "ja": "あのお仕事も、すごく練習しましたから……。\n家のお弟子さん達に、お客さん役になってもらって。", "zh": "那是因为我做了很多练习……\n是请家里的学徒们假装成客人陪我练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2795d54c0f111b3be6a3ff3ab07e1a95b5f7d1b954c7e3882aeb73e78570b64e", "ja": "へえ。お弟子さん達に……。", "zh": "这样啊，找学徒们练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b6c7babdfa067a379b0e613742f82085789125372192b1e3a07043f657ecace7", "ja": "でも、{$P$}も早いですよね？\nてっきり、今朝は私が一番かなって思ってたのに……。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}也来得很早呢。\n我还以为今天是第一个到的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "094b17819dc36f8b4616b28a76fdd7433d0ada2ece835c772b4c338761a3764c", "ja": "えへへ、びっくりしましたぁ。\nいつもこんなに早いんですか？", "zh": "嘿嘿，吓了我一跳。\n制作人平时也这么早吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ede2250c2c52b3694c1c3069a0d0d3d4e6703736842d01921fd4971ed2277e7a", "ja": "いや、今日はたまたまかな。\nなんとなく目が覚めたから、そのまま出てきただけで。", "zh": "没有，只是今天刚好早点来而已。\n不知怎地特别早起，就直接出门了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "362de3df214d325bae45226ee636c6b0ada97b1c406b31e4bebee56a0347b6f9", "ja": "そのままって……あの、朝ごはんは？", "zh": "直接出门……那个，你有吃早餐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d5e153b8a426f74dcb0917a5ec68b7f17a6c951daa7c426c2df5d29fd393340c", "ja": "え？　ああ、そういえば食べてないか。\nまあ、よくあることだよ。", "zh": "咦？哎呀，这么一说我好像忘了吃。\n没关系啦，这是常有的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "87e79ad2c4dad0786b0816202497d0a2f993eb3f3b5a32b94c900b6482b826ed", "ja": "よくあるのはダメですよぉ。お仕事のせいで、\n時間が無いんだって思いますけど……。", "zh": "怎么可以经常不吃早餐呢！虽然因为工作的关系，\n或许你真的没时间吃，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8ce4239db9b24188e3ae87ba5a7c3f3a437fb9d6f014fecb38a47a6dae89b330", "ja": "一日は、おいしい朝ごはんから始まるって言いますし。\nお仕事のためにも、しっかり食べてくださいね？", "zh": "人家都说一天是从美味的早餐开始的。\n这也是为了工作，请你记得好好吃早餐喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dd8ed67e8b6251b7bb7d7fff27c3726dc085d112b0499553edc0ecc735ee375e", "ja": "はは、そうだな。ごめんごめん。\n雪歩の言うとおりだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是，抱歉抱歉。\n雪步，你说得对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e0e4bae8ca1beba6912921076ab464479df0bf24e60dc7ca3e7d53fa42774e0a", "ja": "バリバリ働いて、みんなをしっかりプロデュースする\nためにも、朝ごはんはちゃんと食べないとな！", "zh": "为了尽全力工作打拚，好好培育大家，\n我每天都要记得吃早餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a27d8daac8a52552e63b019ede8670239e791ae53ee5dcd9507943dd2f1276b5", "ja": "え！？　あっ、私は別に、{$P$}に\nもっと働いてって言いたかったわけじゃなくて～！", "zh": "咦！？啊，我并不是希望{$P$}\n工作更努力才要你吃早餐的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "15cc9810864fc245234ce601ce02ae1f379154e6530d0af34f4865f00b549233", "ja": "で、でもでも、今のはそう聞こえちゃうかも……！\nうう、朝からこんなヒドイこと言うなんて……。", "zh": "不、不过，我刚才的说法的确可以这样解释……！\n呜呜，我怎么一大早就说这么过分的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "94fc144e5dfb62835d7a93ff12e1ab2324aada9989f0df57b13f0487f29c408c", "ja": "こんな私は、劇場横の土手に\n穴掘って埋まってますぅ～！", "zh": "我要去剧场旁边的河堤\n挖洞把自己埋起来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0053_1019_p", "source_sha256": "285da23914218d04d80e01ddbdff304a19f35196eed85d346637e87ee3343c88", "ja": "あっ、待ってくれ雪歩！\n俺もそんなつもりじゃ……雪歩ー！", "zh": "啊，等一下，雪步！\n我也不是那个意思……雪步──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
